        {"type": "policy", "source": "security-policy.md", "content": "All SQL statements MUST use bound parameters (SQLAlchemy `text()` with `:name` parameters, or DB-API placeholders with a separate params argument). String interpolation, f-strings, `%` formatting, `.format()`, or string concatenation of request-derived values into SQL is forbidden (CWE-89)."}
      ],
